   "note": "the windows: a voronoi texture (Chebychev, randomness 0, scale 12) on Object coordinates stretched 1.5 in Y by a mapping, through a Constant colour ramp as the factor of a Mix Shader between two Principled BSDFs -- shiny windows and black frames; the windows' colour from a noise texture (Normalize off, i.e. Musgrave) on Object Info > Location through a colour ramp, so each building gets its own",
